OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mostly
OL,6,Fcloudy evening with outbreaks of rain
OL,7,Fin the west. The rain will continue
OL,8,Feast, to all except the southeast,
OL,9,Fovernight. Winds brisk early evening
OL,10,Facross the western coasts and Isles,
OL,11,Fotherwise light.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FDry in the far east at first
OL,14,Fotherwise rain in the north and the
OL,15,Fwest in the morning will become patchy
OL,16,Fand lighter as it spreads southeast in
OL,17,Fthe afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
